ubind @flare
sensor flag @unit @flag
jump 5 equal flag 1
ucontrol flag 1 0 0 0 0
jump 0 always 0 0
sensor item @unit @copper
jump 11 greaterThanEq item 10
ulocate building container 0 @copper cx cy found cblock
ucontrol approach cx cy 3 0 0
ucontrol itemTake cblock @copper 10 0 0
jump 0 always 0 0
ulocate building core 0 @copper kx ky kfound kblock
ucontrol approach kx ky 3 0 0
ucontrol itemDrop kblock 10 0 0 0
jump 0 always 0 0
